{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>General</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whimsical Artefact is a casual exploration game, where your main mechanic is the ability to customize via drawing. You can draw a face, icons for artefacts, and much more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recommended are 4 players, but you can play with as little or as many players as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You explore a procedural bunker with unique rooms. Deadly traps will hinder your exploration but with progressively more artefacts at your arsenal, it may become easier and easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Artefacts may be a great tool in many situations, but the act of identifying and sorting out the deadly ones will prove more and more difficult as you progress through the bunkers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604800?t=1750722837","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604800?t=1750722837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604800/9491c2a025e0bcc1167d302e6051c8948a8e6661/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750722837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604800/9491c2a025e0bcc1167d302e6051c8948a8e6661/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750722837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>General</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whimsical Artefact is a casual exploration game, where your main mechanic is the ability to customize via drawing. You can draw a face, icons for artefacts, and much more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\